---
layout: changelog
title: AACSearch 1.5 is now available on Cloud
date: 2024-04-29
cover: /images/changelog/2024-04-22.png
---

After announcing many new products and features during Init as part of the 1.5 release, we saw great excitement within the community to get started with the newly presented AACSearch 1.5. Although already available on self-hosted, the new AACSearch products and features were yet to be released to Cloud. 

Today, we are excited to say the wait is finally over as we announce the release of AACSearch 1.5 to the Cloud.

